    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Il convient de, il s'agit de, il importe de",
     "texto": [
      "With **il convient de**, **il s'agit de** and **il importe de** + infinitive one expresses what is advisable, what it is about or what matters: **Il convient de partir tôt** (it is advisable to leave early).",
      "**Il s'agit de finir le projet** (it is a matter of finishing the project)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Watch out",
     "texto": [
      "They are impersonal expressions. They do not change according to the person: one says **il convient** even when speaking about many people."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
